// SentinelOne Deep Visibility Query
// Title: Mass File Encryption Behavior
// Description: Detects rapid creation of files with common ransomware extensions.
// Author: Security Team
// Date: 2026-08-01
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1486
// Tactic: Impact
// Severity: Critical
// References:
//   - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1486/

EventType = "File Creation" AND
TgtFileExtension In Contains Anycase (".locked", ".encrypted", ".crypt", ".ryk", ".lockbit")
